./ralph/codex-output/iteration-000012-20260518-170826.log:1144:- Schema changes are versioned SQL files under internal/controlplane/store/migrate/migrations/ named NNNN_name.up.sql (required) + NNNN_name.down.sql (optional, reversible-only), embedded via //go:embed. The migrate.Migrator runner owns a checksummed schema_migrations ledger, serialises with a pg advisory lock, and runs each migration in its own transaction. Migrator.Up is idempotent and refuses dirty / unknown-version / checksum-mismatch databases (errors.Is sentinels ErrDirtyDatabase/ErrUnknownVersion/ErrChecksumMismatch). NEVER edit an applied migration file (trips ErrChecksumMismatch by design) — add a new higher-versioned migration. Persistence tests are integration tests: they connect via YALLA_TEST_DATABASE_URL, create an isolated throwaway database per test, and t.Skip when the env var is unset so go test ./... stays green without Postgres. docker-compose.yml at repo root provisions local Postgres. pgx (github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 + pgxpool) is the Postgres driver.
